		<COMMENTS><![CDATA[This component uses System.Net.Mail to send an email to one or more recipients.
The body can be plain text or it can contain HTML.
Optionally 1 ore more attachments can be added to the mail.

Example calls:

INVOKE OTS_Mail.SendMail
WITH
SELECT 'JohnDo@MyCompany.com', 'TestMail1', 'Hello world!'


INVOKE OTS_Mail.SendMailHtml
WITH
SELECT 'JohnDo@MyCompany.com', 'TestMail1', '<u>Hello<u><br/><b>world!</b>'

INVOKE OTS_Mail.SendMailHtml
WITH
SELECT 'JohnDo@MyCompany.com;JaneDo@MyCompany.com', 'TestMail1', '<u>Hello<u><br/><b>world!</b>', 'C:\usd90setup\Doc\AddNote.pdf', 'C:\usd90setup\BITMAPS\usdlogo.bmp']]></COMMENTS>
	</T_EXP_DEF>
